  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Collect stars to unlock the chest.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Collectez des \xE9toiles pour d\xE9verrouiller la poitrine."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Sammeln Sie Sterne, um die Brust freizuschalten.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Raccogli le stelle per sbloccare il petto.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u80F8\u3092\u89E3\u304D\u653E\u3064\u305F\u3081\u306B\u661F\u3092\u96C6\u3081\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uAC00\uC2B4\uC744 \uC7A0\uAE08 \uD574\uC81C\uD558\uAE30 \uC704\uD574
      \uBCC4\uC744 \uBAA8\uC73C\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Colete estrelas para desbloquear o peito.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0421\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0437\u0432\u0435\u0437\u0434\u044B,
      \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C
      \u0433\u0440\u0443\u0434\u044C."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Recoge estrellas para desbloquear el cofre.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
