--- !u!114 &8644034753697928482
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1863995584229460506}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: We and our partners use your data to personalize ads and measure performance.
      You can choose to accept or reject personalized advertising.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Nous et nos partenaires utilisons vos donn\xE9es pour personnaliser les
      annonces et mesurer les performances. "
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: 'Wir und unsere Partner verwenden Ihre Daten, um Anzeigen zu personalisieren
      und die Leistung zu messen. '
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: 'Noi e i nostri partner utilizziamo i tuoi dati per personalizzare gli
      annunci e misurare le prestazioni. '
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u5F53\u793E\u3068\u5F53\u793E\u306E\u30D1\u30FC\u30C8\u30CA\u30FC\u306F\u3001\u30C7\u30FC\u30BF\u3092\u4F7F\u7528\u3057\u3066\u5E83\u544A\u3092\u30D1\u30FC\u30BD\u30CA\u30E9\u30A4\u30BA\u3057\u3001\u30D1\u30D5\u30A9\u30FC\u30DE\u30F3\u30B9\u3092\u6E2C\u5B9A\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB2F9\uC0AC\uC640 \uD30C\uD2B8\uB108\uB294 \uADC0\uD558\uC758 \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C
      \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD558\uC5EC \uAD11\uACE0\uB97C \uAC1C\uC778\uD654\uD558\uACE0
      \uC131\uB2A5\uC744 \uCE21\uC815\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. "
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "N\xF3s e nossos parceiros usamos seus dados para personalizar an\xFAncios
      e medir o desempenho. "
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u041C\u044B \u0438 \u043D\u0430\u0448\u0438 \u043F\u0430\u0440\u0442\u043D\u0435\u0440\u044B
      \u0438\u0441\u043F\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0437\u0443\u0435\u043C \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0438
      \u0434\u0430\u043D\u043D\u044B\u0435 \u0434\u043B\u044F \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043E\u043D\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438
      \u0440\u0435\u043A\u043B\u0430\u043C\u044B \u0438 \u0438\u0437\u043C\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F
      \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0438\u0437\u0432\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0438. "
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: 'Nosotros y nuestros socios usamos sus datos para personalizar los anuncios
      y medir el rendimiento. '
    Object: {fileID: 0}
