--- !u!114 &8871988384961422967
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8353657996926174668}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Your change will apply next time you open the game
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: Votre modification s'appliquera la prochaine fois que vous ouvrirez le
      jeu
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Ihre \xC4nderung gilt das n\xE4chste Mal, wenn Sie das Spiel \xF6ffnen"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: "La tua modifica si applicher\xE0 la prossima volta che aprirai il gioco"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u6B21\u56DE\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u3092\u958B\u304F\u3068\u304D\u306B\u5909\u66F4\u304C\u9069\u7528\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3059"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB2E4\uC74C\uC5D0 \uAC8C\uC784\uC744 \uC5F4 \uB54C \uBCC0\uACBD \uC0AC\uD56D\uC774
      \uC801\uC6A9\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Sua mudan\xE7a ser\xE1 aplicada na pr\xF3xima vez que voc\xEA abrir o
      jogo"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0412\u0430\u0448\u0435 \u0438\u0437\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435
      \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043F\u0440\u0438\u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
      \u0432 \u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044E\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0437,
      \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0432\u044B \u043E\u0442\u043A\u0440\u043E\u0435\u0442\u0435
      \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0443"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Tu cambio se aplicar\xE1 la pr\xF3xima vez que abra el juego"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
